   "id": 646417,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"8\">\n    <li>A gardener is buying some topsoil and compost to fill his garden. His budget is $70. Topsoil costs $1.89 per cubic foot, and compost costs $4.59 per cubic foot.<br> Select <strong>three</strong> statements or representations that correctly describe the gardener's constraints in this situation. Let <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> represent the cubic feet of topsoil and <span data-math=\"c\">c</span> the cubic feet of compost.</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p>a: The combination of 7.5 cubic feet of topsoil and 12 cubic feet of compost is within the gardener's budget.</p>\n  <p>b: If the line on the graph represents the equation <span data-math=\"1.89t+4.59c=70\">1.89t+4.59c=70</span>, this graph represents the solutions to the gardener's budget constraint.</p>\n<img alt=\"Graph of an inequality.\" class=\"atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"286\" src=\"exercises/media/98e6e592f52399ac.svg\" width=\"300\"> \n\n<p>c: <span data-math=\"1.89t+4.59c≥70\">1.89t+4.59c≥70</span></p>\n  <p>d: The combination of 5 cubic feet of topsoil and 20 cubic feet of compost is within the gardener's budget.</p>\n  <p>e: <span data-math=\"1.89t+4.59c≤70\">1.89t+4.59c≤70</span></p>\n  <p>f: If the line on the graph represents the equation <span data-math=\"1.89t+4.59c=70\">1.89t+4.59c=70</span>, this graph represents the solutions to the gardener's budget constraint.</p>\n  <p><img alt=\"Graph of an inequality.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"286\" src=\"exercises/media/5a2c1d9dd03fa784.svg\" width=\"318\"></p>",
